          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On March 29, 1976, at 5:10 PM, a witness observed and photographed a circular, orange-colored object flying in the sky. The object moved slowly, stopped momentarily, then resumed flight at high speed on a north-south trajectory. No noise was heard during the object's movement. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon, for which we have insufficient information.",
